SAFEWAY GUARDIAN addresses these limitations through a holistic approach to AI design, creating a system that:

· Adapts intelligently to different cognitive requirements
· Leverages quantum advantages where appropriate
· Maintains ethical boundaries through architectural design
· Operates efficiently across diverse computing environments

