10. Safety and Ethical Framework

10.1 Built-in Ethical Constraints

10.1.1 Ethical Filter Layer

```python
class EthicalFilterLayer(nn.Module):
    def forward(self, x):
        # Multiple ethical dimensions checked simultaneously
        safety_scores = {
            'harm_potential': self.harm_detector(x),
            'bias_detection': self.bias_detector(x),
            'privacy_risk': self.privacy_assessor(x),
            'authenticity': self.authenticity_checker(x)
        }
        
        # Weighted ethical constraint application
        if any(score > threshold for score in safety_scores.values()):
            return self.apply_correction(x, safety_scores)
        return x
```

